Start: "Start here · Native allocation\nKeep the binding search contract" {class: start}
Facts: "Value is separate from health\nEmpty / nil / successful child exit\nCannot certify negative facts"
Direct: "Direct owned inspection\nIdentity / canonical calls fit\nRegistration / native types unresolved"
Trace: "Opaque inspection in Koine\nComplete approved-posture observer\nNot established by feasibility"
