Budget: "Two host temporary credits\nSocketpair uses two, then one\nPersistent IPC + two-FD walk cannot fit"
Health: "Negative-fact proof remains required\nCFError or finite table is insufficient\nNo implicit UNKNOWN-only weakening"
Lifetime: "Own blocked + unreaped children\nParent exit does not prove reclamation\nNo accumulation across host restart"
Contract: "Complete allocation design next\nResolve bootstrap / TCC / health / lifetime\nKeep host limits, domain, grants + seams"
Listener: "Observe accept before NIO suppression\nError / delay / scheduled read / resume\nEventual replies do not clear backoff"
Subjects: "Then construct independent subjects\nTransient-open + suppressed-error controls\nFour searches beside listener / store / actions"
